      "writtenOn": "2025-01-20T06:04:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack, I think following the stable version(`6.1.123-1`) looks better. BTW, I think it might be better if the build fails for `avf` variant to forcibly follow the stable version.",
      "parentUuid": "d9297d7a_141fa2be",
